From 0df0252782816e401193596615e0e4fbe6952793 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Destrudos6 <3411622425@qq.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 12:49:27 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] 0056: Fix APK update download and install reliability

- Switch APK storage from cacheDir to externalFilesDir (more persistent,
  not cleared by OS, more reliable with FileProvider)
- Use version-specific filename (bisub-update-NN.apk) so repeated
  check-update reuses already downloaded APK instead of re-downloading
- Add download progress dialog with percentage indicator
- Verify Content-Length after download to prevent installing truncated APK
- Clean up old version APK files before downloading new one
- Add external-files-path to FileProvider XML (with cache-path fallback)
- Add bisub_update_installing string resource (en + zh-CN)
---
 .../newpipe/bisub/BisubUpdateChecker.java     | 128 +++++++++++++++---
 app/src/main/res/values-zh-rCN/strings.xml    |   1 +
 app/src/main/res/values/strings.xml           |   1 +
 app/src/main/res/xml/bisub_file_paths.xml     |   3 +
 4 files changed, 117 insertions(+), 16 deletions(-)

